### Variable — change the port if Nest is running elsewhere
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Reporting — C1 category breakdown (all categories, period, effectuation filter)
# effectivated=true: effectuated transactions only; effectivated=false: non-effectuated only
GET {{baseUrl}}/reporting/categories/breakdown?startDate=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2026-12-31T23:59:59.999Z&
  effectivated=false

### Reporting — breakdown with category subset (comma-separated UUIDs)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reporting/categories/breakdown?startDate=2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z&endDate=2026-05-31T23:59:59.999Z&
  effectivated=false&categoriesId=4ed8b634-a922-438b-b92e-2253871107a6,b3cca725-9fc4-43f5-b039-cc2da66c1a78
